## Original Content
Antes de ser advogado, Agostinho Pereira de Miranda foi inspetor da PJ, tendo investigado o caso do atentado à bomba contra a Embaixada de Cuba em 1976. 2.ª parte de uma longa conversa com Luís Rosa.

## Summary
This article is the second part of a long conversation with Luís Rosa about Agostinho Pereira de Miranda, who worked as an inspector for the Portuguese judicial police (PJ) before becoming a lawyer. It covers his investigation of the 1976 bomb attack on the Cuban Embassy and claims that Cuban secret services attempted to recruit him that same year.

## Key Points
- Agostinho Pereira de Miranda was an inspector of the Polícia Judiciária (PJ) before his career as a lawyer
- He investigated the bomb attack against the Cuban Embassy in 1976
- Cuban secret services allegedly attempted to recruit him in 1976
- This is the second part of a long interview/conversation with Luís Rosa


